  "description": "Production-ready linq2db adapter for SharpCoreDB.Functional. Zero-dependency Option/Fin/Seq APIs, compile-time LINQ safety, BulkCopy batching, full type mappings (ULID/GUID), and low-overhead queries. Perfect for AI/agentic and GraphRAG workloads on .NET 10 / C# 14.",
